{"OrganizationAuditLogsEndpoint uses OptimizedCursorPaginator with order_by='-datetime', but OptimizedCursorPaginator.get_item_key applies math.floor/ceil to the raw field value and will raise a TypeError for AuditLogEntry.datetime (DateTimeField) when optimized_pagination=true": 0.9845867156982422, "OrganizationAuditLogsEndpoint computes enable_advanced using organization_context.member.has_global_access without checking member for None; RpcUserOrganizationContext.member can be None and this will raise AttributeError for non-superuser requests": 0.8349121809005737, "The spans buffer Lua script merges ZSETs using ZUNIONSTORE without specifying an AGGREGATE mode, which can alter end_timestamp_precise scores when the same payload exists in multiple sets, breaking ordering and eviction semantics based on timestamps": 0.6431865692138672, "The span buffer eviction (zpopmin) can remove the segment/root span based on end_timestamp_precise ordering while the has_root_span flag remains set, causing segments to be flushed with root timeout despite missing their root span payload": 0.8666311502456665, "The spans buffer changes treat span-buf:s:* keys as ZSETs (zadd/zscan/zcard/zunionstore), but there is no compatibility handling for existing non-ZSET keys within the Redis TTL window, risking WRONGTYPE errors and ingestion/flush failures during rollout": 0.8427035212516785}